{"blocks":[["Person/Daron%20Acemoglu/","source-block-287","Best known for work on how institutions shape prosperity, democracy, inequality, labor, and long-run economic development.",["Daron Acemoglu","Bio"]],["Person/Daron%20Acemoglu/","source-block-414","A useful thought leader for questioning technological inevitability: he tends to ask who benefits, who loses power, and what kinds of institutions channel innovation toward shared prosperity.",["Daron Acemoglu","Bio"]],["Person/Daron%20Acemoglu/","source-block-610","On AI, his stance is not simple rejection but sustained skepticism toward hype, concentrated corporate control, labor displacement, weakened democracy, and systems that make people less capable rather than more capable.",["Daron Acemoglu","Bio"]],["Person/Daron%20Acemoglu/","source-block-834","His work with Simon Johnson on Power and Progress and related research argues for a more pro-worker, pro-human direction for AI and automation.",["Daron Acemoglu","Bio"]],["Person/Daron%20Acemoglu/","source-block-984","Suggested Tags",["Daron Acemoglu"]],["Person/Daron%20Acemoglu/","source-block-1005","economics",["Daron Acemoglu","Suggested Tags"]],["Person/Daron%20Acemoglu/","source-block-1019","political economy",["Daron Acemoglu","Suggested Tags"]],["Person/Daron%20Acemoglu/","source-block-1041","institutions",["Daron Acemoglu","Suggested Tags"]],["Person/Daron%20Acemoglu/","source-block-1058","democracy",["Daron Acemoglu","Suggested Tags"]],["Person/Daron%20Acemoglu/","source-block-1072","inequality",["Daron Acemoglu","Suggested Tags"]],["Person/Daron%20Acemoglu/","source-block-1087","automation",["Daron Acemoglu","Suggested Tags"]],["Person/Daron%20Acemoglu/","source-block-1102","artificial intelligence",["Daron Acemoglu","Suggested Tags"]],["Person/Daron%20Acemoglu/","source-block-1130","labor",["Daron Acemoglu","Suggested Tags"]],["Person/Daron%20Acemoglu/","source-block-1140","Related",["Daron Acemoglu"]],["Person/Daron%20Acemoglu/","source-block-1154","