Abram/Book/96/The%20Spell%20of%20the%20Sensuous/","source-block-99","The Spell of the Sensuous: Perception and Language in a More-Than-Human World",[]],["Person/David%20Abram/Book/96/The%20Spell%20of%20the%20Sensuous/","source-block-271","About",["The Spell of the Sensuous: Perception and Language in a More-Than-Human World"]],["Person/David%20Abram/Book/96/The%20Spell%20of%20the%20Sensuous/","source-block-283","Explores the dependence of perception and language on embodied relationships with the more-than-human world.",["The Spell of the Sensuous: Perception and Language in a More-Than-Human World","About"]],["Person/David%20Abram/Book/96/The%20Spell%20of%20the%20Sensuous/","source-block-396","Original publisher: Pantheon.",["The Spell of the Sensuous: Perception and Language in a More-Than-Human World","About"]],["Person/David%20Abram/Book/96/The%20Spell%20of%20the%20Sensuous/","source-block-430","The Reweaving syllabus cites the 1997 Vintage paperback edition.",["The Spell of the Sensuous: Perception and Language in a More-Than-Human World","About"]],["Person/David%20Abram/Book/96/The%20Spell%20of%20the%20Sensuous/","source-block-499","Links",["The Spell of the Sensuous: Perception and Language in a More-Than-Human World"]],["Person/David%20Abram/Book/96/The%20Spell%20of%20the%20Sensuous/","source-block-511","Course/Reweaving Project/Syllabus/2027 Spring",["The Spell of the Sensuous: Perception and Language in a More-Than-Human World","Links"]],["Person/David%20Abram/Book/96/The%20Spell%20of%20the%20Sensuous/","source-block-565","First-edition bibliographic record",["The Spell of the Sensuous: Perception and Language in a More-Than-Human World","Links"]],["Person/David%20Baker/","source-block-111","David Baker",[]],["Person/David%20Baker/","source-block-183","About",["David Baker"]],["Person/David%20Baker/","source-block-195","American jazz composer and educator (1931–2016).",["David Baker","About"]],["Person/David%20Baker/","source-block-258","Wrote dozens of books on jazz, including Jazz Improvisation (1988).",["David Baker","About"]],["Person/David%20Baker/","source-block-336","Gave the bebop scales their name, because players of the bebop era such as Person/Charlie Parker and Person/Dizzy Gillespie used them often.",["David Baker","About"]],["Person/David%20Crawshaw/","source-block-41","David Crawshaw",[]],["Person/David%20Crawshaw/","source-block-60","Bio",["David Crawshaw"]],["Person/David%20Crawshaw/","source-block-70","Software engineer and writer behind crawshaw.io, focused on developer tooling, agents, and systems engineering.",["David Crawshaw","Bio"]],["Person/David%20Crawshaw/","source-block-190","Links",["David Crawshaw"]],["Person/David%20Crawshaw/","source-block-202","crawshaw.io",["David Crawshaw","Links"]],["Person/David%20Crawshaw/","source-block-242","GitHub (@crawshaw)",["David Crawshaw","Links"]],["Person/David%20Crawshaw/","source-block-296","X (@davidcrawshaw)",["David Crawshaw","Links"]],["Person/David%20Crawshaw/","source-block-356","Related",["David Crawshaw"]],["Person/David%20Crawshaw/","source-block-370","Person/David Crawshaw/Blog/26/02/Eight more months of agents",["David Crawshaw","Related"]],["Person/David%20Crawshaw/Blog/26/02/Eight%20more%20months%20of%20agents/","source-block-78","Eight more months of agents",[]],["Person/David%20Crawshaw/Blog/26/02/Eight%20more%20months%20of%20agents/","source-block-166","Author: Person/David Crawshaw",["Eight more months of agents"]],["Person/David%20Crawshaw/Blog/26/02/Eight%20more%20months%20of%20agents/","source-block-207","Source: crawshaw.io",["Eight more months of agents"]],["Person/David%20Crawshaw/Blog/26/02/Eight%20more%20months%20of%20agents/","source-block-254","Journal link: 2026/02/17",["Eight more months of agents"]],["Person/David%20Crawshaw/Blog/26/02/Eight%20more%20months%20of%20agents/","source-block-286","High-level takeaways",["Eight more months of agents"]],["Person/David%20Crawshaw/Blog/26/02/Eight%20more%20months%20of%20agents/","source-block-313","I 100% agree with most of this framing on the state of AI-assisted engineering: frontier model capability is moving quickly, practical workflows matter most, and teams that adapt their tooling around agents gain a real speed advantage.",["Eight more months of agents","High-level takeaways"]],["Person/David%20Crawshaw/Blog/26/02/Eight%20more%20months%20of%20agents/","source-block-553","Notes on the argument (summary + excerpts)",["Eight more months of agents"]],["Person/David%20Crawshaw/Blog/26/02/Eight%20more%20months%20of%20agents/","source-block-602","Model progress is the main driver right now; harnesses matter, but capability jumps are coming mostly from frontier models.",["Eight more months of agents","Notes on the argument (summary + excerpts)"]],["Person/David%20Crawshaw/Blog/26/02/Eight%20more%20months%20of%20agents/","source-block-938","The coding workflow is shifting away from IDE-centered interaction toward agent-centered interaction.",["Eight more months of agents","Notes on the argument (summary + excerpts)"]],["Person/David%20Crawshaw/Blog/26/02/Eight%20more%20months%20of%20agents/","source-block-1231","Using weaker/cheaper models can teach the wrong operational instincts when the frontier keeps moving.",["Eight more months of agents","Notes on the argument (summary + excerpts)"]],["Person/David%20Crawshaw/Blog/26/02/Eight%20more%20months%20of%20agents/","source-block-1541","Built-in safety sandboxes create too much friction for serious use; in practice, people bring their own isolated runtime.",["Eight more months of agents","Notes on the argument (summary + excerpts)"]],["Person/David%20Crawshaw/Blog/26/02/Eight%20more%20months%20of%20agents/","source-block-1828","He is building [[exe.dev]] to make unconstrained, disposable VM-based agent execution practical for everyday one-liner ideas.",["Eight more months of agents","Notes on the argument (summary + excerpts)"]],["Person/David%20Crawshaw/Blog/26/02/Eight%20more%20months%20of%20agents/","source-block-2275","His broader product thesis: customers now arrive with agents, so products should be easy for programmers (and thus agents) to compose against.",["Eight more months of agents","Notes on the argument (summary + excerpts)"]],["Person/David%20Crawshaw/Blog/26/02/Eight%20more%20months%20of%20agents/","source-block-2603","Personal annotations integrated",["Eight more months of agents"]],["Person/David%20Crawshaw/Blog/26/02/Eight%20more%20months%20of%20agents/","source-block-2641","The points above line up with my own experience, including doing similar CLI-centric workflows (e.g., with langstar) instead of relying on heavy UI-first flows.",["Eight more months of agents","Personal annotations integrated"]],["Person/David%20Dow/","source-block-162","David Dow",[]],["Person/David%20Dow/","source-block-176","Bio",["David Dow"]],["Person/David%20Dow/","source-block-186","Composer and performer working with EEG and interactive systems",["David Dow","Bio"]],["Person/David%20Dow/","source-block-254","Works",["David Dow"]],["Person/David%20Dow/","source-block-266","ICMC/25/d6/1130 Concert 16/07 Moments Between Thoughts",["David Dow","Works"]],["Person/David%20Dow/","source-block-329","Instruments",["David Dow"]],["Person/David%20Dow/","source-block-347","Roli Seaboard Rise 49 MIDI controller",["David Dow","Instruments"]],["Person/David%20Duong/","source-block-48","Person/David Duong/GitHub https://github.com/dqbd",[]]],"format_version":5}